# ☕ MochaMoments  
A modern, stylish coffee shop web application inspired by Starbucks — redesigned with a custom theme, unique layout, and fully interactive menu. Built using **React.js**.

---

## 🔗 Live Demo  
👉 **View the website:**  
https://falshrutimansuriya.github.io/MochaMoments/

---

## 📌 Overview  
MochaMoments is a custom-built coffee shop website created using **React.js**, featuring a dynamic menu, clean UI, routing, and a cart system. The design and colors are customized to create a unique premium look different from Starbucks.

---

## ✨ Features  
- 🧋 Fully interactive menu with **quantity buttons (+/-)**  
- 🛒 Add & remove items from the cart  
- 🗂 Organized pages using **React Router**  
- 🎨 Custom theme, colors, and branding  
- 📱 Fully responsive UI  
- 🌐 Hosted using **GitHub Pages**

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack  
- **React.js**  
- **React Router**  
- **Bootstrap / Custom CSS**  
- **GitHub Pages (deployment)**

